Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.94,0:20:30.40,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\3c&HB02A9B&}叛逃忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:33.28,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB02A9B&}有点本领但不太常规
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:34.62,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\3c&HB02A9B&}最近处境不太安稳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:35.99,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\3c&HB02A9B&}人设跟别人撞车了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.99,0:20:37.87,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\3c&HB02A9B&}排名要下降了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.87,0:20:40.79,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(107,0)\3c&HB02A9B&}是不是傻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.79,0:20:44.54,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB02A9B&}身为职业只要闭嘴干活就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:46.17,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB02A9B&}不用你管
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.17,0:20:50.17,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB02A9B&}我对你这么好还看不起我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:52.97,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)\3c&HB02A9B&}悄悄摆一个招牌姿势
